    "lessonTitle": {
      "zh-CN": "把大地图拆成几个小问题",
      "en": "Turn one map into several small problems"
    },
    "lessonBody": {
      "zh-CN": "每个国家都有自己的完整推理链。国家标签可暂时淡化其他区域；遇到卡点可请求一个必然步骤，误填后可检查或只清除错误标记。",
      "en": "Each country has its own complete reasoning chain. Country tabs can mute the others; if you stall, request one certain step, and after a mistake you can check the board or remove only wrong marks."
    },
    "completionTitle": {
      "zh-CN": "序章完成",
      "en": "Prologue complete"
    },
    "completionBody": {
      "zh-CN": "三张练习页都已归档。瓦罗王的第一席已经摆好，内海七国的正式版图现已开放。",
      "en": "All three practice leaves are filed. King Varo's first course is laid, and the formal map of the Seven Kingdoms of the Inner Sea is now open."
    }
